# Chrome Origin Trial token unlocking the experimental html-in-canvas API
# (ParticleScroll, DecryptReveal) for real visitors, no chrome://flags needed
# on their end. Origin-bound — must match the exact production origin
# (currently https://blessed-moon.vercel.app, see src/lib/site-config.ts).
# Register at https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials/#/view_trial/3478467762190286849
# See docs/tasks/TASK-html-in-canvas-origin-trial.md for details.
# Optional: the site works fine without it (graceful fallback), just without
# the native dissolve effect for visitors outside the trial.
ORIGIN_TRIAL_TOKEN_HTML_IN_CANVAS=
